  {"comment": "Committed flush (MoveFace1 F5): the end and the base's side are one face with both names; the base's far side as it was."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "move_face", "body": "F2.b0", "faces": ["F4:side(c4[c3,c1])"],
    "transform": {"type": "translate_xyz", "x": -10, "y": 0, "z": 0}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "MoveFace1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 1, "body": "Body1", "volume": 28500,
    "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [60, 40, 25]}, "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body1", "has_face": "F2:side(c4[c3,c1])"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body1", "has_face": "F2:side(c2[c1,c3])"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body1", "has_face": "F4:side(c4[c3,c1])"}},

  {"comment": "Edited past the base's side: the block overhangs 4 mm, its underside a step face of its own."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F5", "def": {"type": "move_face", "body": "F2.b0", "faces": ["F4:side(c4[c3,c1])"],
    "transform": {"type": "translate_xyz", "x": -14, "y": 0, "z": 0}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "MoveFace1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 1, "body": "Body1", "volume": 29100,
    "bbox": {"min": [-4, 0, 0], "max": [60, 40, 25]}, "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body1", "has_face": "F5:step(F4:side(c4[c3,c1]))"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body1", "has_face": "F4:side(c4[c3,c1])"}},

  {"comment": "Edited short of it: the faces' own rebuild, as before."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F5", "def": {"type": "move_face", "body": "F2.b0", "faces": ["F4:side(c4[c3,c1])"],
    "transform": {"type": "translate_xyz", "x": -9.999, "y": 0, "z": 0}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "MoveFace1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body1", "volume": 28499.85, "no_face": "F5:step(F4:side(c4[c3,c1]))"}},

  {"comment": "Up to an object without a distance: the base's side as a face, then the body itself (its first flat face in front of the end)."},
